{
  "id": "the-simpsons---6x06---treehouse-of-horror-v",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 6x06 - Treehouse of Horror V",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 6x06 - Treehouse of Horror V.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T20:06:01.347Z",
  "lineCount": 265,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Hello, once again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1536,
      "endMs": 3238
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "As usual, I must warn you all that this year's Halloween show is very scary...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 3438,
      "endMs": 8610
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "...and those of you with young children may want to send them off to bed and...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 8810,
      "endMs": 12781
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Oh, my. It seems the show is so scary, Congress won't even let us show it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 12948,
      "endMs": 18253
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Instead they've suggested the 1947 classic Glenn Ford movie...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 18420,
      "endMs": 21957
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "...Two Hundred Miles to Oregon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 22124,
      "endMs": 23859
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Well, it was a long trip, but we're almost there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 78151,
      "endMs": 81687
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Homer, did you remember to lock the front door of the house?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 81888,
      "endMs": 84857
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Well, it's been two long trips, but we're finally almost there again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 87260,
      "endMs": 91164
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "When you locked the front door, did you remember to lock the back door?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 91330,
      "endMs": 94734
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Oh, no! We left Grampa back at the gas station!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 98671,
      "endMs": 102542
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "What about Grampa?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 103910,
      "endMs": 105945
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Hello! Hi!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 110149,
      "endMs": 111417
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "We're here! Oh, goody.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 111584,
      "endMs": 113119
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "The sea monkeys I ordered have arrived.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 113286,
      "endMs": 115088
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Look at them cavort and caper.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 115788,
      "endMs": 117557
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Sir, they're the new winter caretakers for the lodge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 117757,
      "endMs": 120660
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Yes, they work hard and they play hard.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 120827,
      "endMs": 123996
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "This house has quite a long and colorful history.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 124197,
      "endMs": 127033
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "It was built on an ancient Indian burial ground...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 127200,
      "endMs": 129869
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "...and was the setting of Satanic rituals, witch burnings...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 130036,
      "endMs": 133639
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "...and five John Denver Christmas specials.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 133806,
      "endMs": 136542
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "John Denver.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 137443,
      "endMs": 139078
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "That's odd. Usually the blood gets off at the second floor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 144917,
      "endMs": 148588
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Hey, I found a shortcut through your hedge maze.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 155761,
      "endMs": 158230
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Why, you little...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 158397,
      "endMs": 159665
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "No, no. Go easy on the wee one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 159831,
      "endMs": 161633
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "His father's gonna go crazy and chop them all into haggis.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 161800,
      "endMs": 165070
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "What's haggis?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 165237,
      "endMs": 166438
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Boy, you read my thoughts! You've got the shinning.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 166638,
      "endMs": 169975
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "You mean shining. You want to get sued?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 170175,
      "endMs": 172978
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Now, look, boy, if your da goes gaga...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 173145,
      "endMs": 176014
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "...you just use that shin of yours to call me and I'll come a-running.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 176181,
      "endMs": 181720
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "But don't be reading my mind between 4 and 5.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 181920,
      "endMs": 184890
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "That's Willie's time!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 185057,
      "endMs": 186325
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Yes, by cutting off cable TV and the beer supply...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 189628,
      "endMs": 193265
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "...I can ensure an honest winter's work out of those lowlifes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 193432,
      "endMs": 196268
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Sir, did you ever stop to think that maybe it was doing this...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 196435,
      "endMs": 199338
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "...that caused the previous caretakers to go insane and murder their families?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 199504,
      "endMs": 203175
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Perhaps. Tell you what, we come back and everyone's slaughtered...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 203342,
      "endMs": 206411
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "...I owe you a Coke.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 206578,
      "endMs": 207913
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Cable's out. Think I'll have a beer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 215220,
      "endMs": 217923
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Not a drop in the house. What do you know.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 219124,
      "endMs": 221426
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Homer, I'm impressed. You're taking this quite well.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 221593,
      "endMs": 224296
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "I'll kill you! I'll kill all of you!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 225096,
      "endMs": 226831
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Homer! Sorry. Sorry. Don't worry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 227031,
      "endMs": 229968
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "There's plenty I can do to keep myself occupied.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 230134,
      "endMs": 232537
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Maybe I'll check out that ax collection.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 232704,
      "endMs": 234906
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "See you later.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 235073,
      "endMs": 236774
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Mom, is Dad gonna kill us?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 236975,
      "endMs": 238610
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "We're just gonna have to wait and see.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 238776,
      "endMs": 240745
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "So, what'll it be, Homer? Moe, give me a beer!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 244949,
      "endMs": 247118
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "No. Not unless you kill your family.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 247285,
      "endMs": 249120
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Why should I kill my family?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 249287,
      "endMs": 251289
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "They'd be much happier as ghosts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 251489,
      "endMs": 253057
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "You don't look so happy. Oh, I'm happy. I'm very happy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 253224,
      "endMs": 256427
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "See? Now waste your family, I'll give you a beer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 256961,
      "endMs": 259197
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Homer? Homie?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 260164,
      "endMs": 263167
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "What he's typed will be a window into his madness.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 263668,
      "endMs": 266371
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "\"Feeling fine.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 271042,
      "endMs": 272610
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Wow, that's a relief.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 272810,
      "endMs": 274579
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "This is less encouraging.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 286524,
      "endMs": 288192
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Well, what do you think, Marge?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 291129,
      "endMs": 293197
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "All I need is a title.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 293464,
      "endMs": 295533
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "I was thinking along the lines of...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 296900,
      "endMs": 298735
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "...No TV and No Beer Make Homer something, something.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 298902,
      "endMs": 303340
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Go Crazy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 303540,
      "endMs": 304875
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Don't mind if I do!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 305075,
      "endMs": 307310
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Stay away from me, Homer!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 316219,
      "endMs": 317721
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Give me the bat, Marge! Give me the bat!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 317888,
      "endMs": 320257
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Give me the bat! Come on. Give me the bat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 320457,
      "endMs": 322559
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Give me the bat...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 322726,
      "endMs": 324428
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Scaredy cat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 325829,
      "endMs": 327597
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "You stay here till you're no longer insane.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 333537,
      "endMs": 336173
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Chili would be good tonight.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 336339,
      "endMs": 338275
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Homer, it's Moe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 341445,
      "endMs": 343413
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Look, some of the ghouls and I are a little concerned...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 343547,
      "endMs": 346149
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "...the project isn't moving forward. - Can't murder now. Eating.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 346316,
      "endMs": 349352
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "For crying out loud. Come on. No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 349519,
      "endMs": 353023
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Here's Johnny!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 358228,
      "endMs": 360130
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "David Letterman!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 361731,
      "endMs": 364768
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Hi, David. I'm Grampa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 364935,
      "endMs": 367637
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "I'm Mike Wallace. I'm Morley Safer. And I'm Ed Bradley.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 369205,
      "endMs": 371941
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "All this and Andy Rooney tonight on 60 Minutes!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 372108,
      "endMs": 374677
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Hello, police, this is Marge Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 378748,
      "endMs": 380650
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "My husband is on a murderous rampage. Over.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 380850,
      "endMs": 383352
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Well, thank God that's over. I was worried there for a second.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 383552,
      "endMs": 386989
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "No answer. Don't worry, Mom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 387189,
      "endMs": 388858
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "I can use my shinning to call Willie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 389025,
      "endMs": 392828
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "And that was the first time she'd ever flown a plane.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 395231,
      "endMs": 397833
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "The little fat boy and his family are in trouble.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 398768,
      "endMs": 400970
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "I'm coming to rescue the lot of you!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 401437,
      "endMs": 403873
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "All right, loony, show me what you got.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 404840,
      "endMs": 408477
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Is that the best you can do?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 408644,
      "endMs": 411314
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Oh, my. I hope that rug was Scotchgarded.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 411480,
      "endMs": 414417
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Must kill family.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 415518,
      "endMs": 418254
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Had been given rifles, but no ammunition.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 431667,
      "endMs": 434237
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Fortunately, there was a hardware store. Dad, look!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 434503,
      "endMs": 436939
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Television! Teacher! Mother! Secret lover.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 437106,
      "endMs": 440176
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Urge to kill fading.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 440476,
      "endMs": 442945
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Fading. Fading.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 443112,
      "endMs": 445581
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Rising! Fading.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 445748,
      "endMs": 447950
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Fading. Gone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 448150,
      "endMs": 450953
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Come, family. Sit in the snow with Daddy...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 455023,
      "endMs": 457892
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "...and let us all bask in television's warm, glowing, warming glow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 458059,
      "endMs": 463732
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Live from Broadway, it's The Tony Awards.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 465767,
      "endMs": 468436
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "With your hosts, Tyne Daly and Hal Linden.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 468603,
      "endMs": 471673
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Homer, change channel. Can't. Frozen.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 471840,
      "endMs": 475110
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Urge to kill rising.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 478480,
      "endMs": 481683
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "You know, Marge, I've had my share of troubles.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 485188,
      "endMs": 487324
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "But sitting here now with you and the kids...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 487490,
      "endMs": 489526
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "...in our cozy home in this beautiful, free country...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 489693,
      "endMs": 492395
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "...it just makes me feel that I'm really a lucky guy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 492562,
      "endMs": 496366
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Dad, your hand is jammed in the toaster!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 496566,
      "endMs": 499402
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 499636,
      "endMs": 501037
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Get it off! Get it off! Get it off of me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 503807,
      "endMs": 507677
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Dad, it's in there again!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 511615,
      "endMs": 513250
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "No! It's stuck on my hand.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 513917,
      "endMs": 516419
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "This shouldn't be too hard to fix, with the right tools.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 519723,
      "endMs": 523860
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "There. Better than new.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 529065,
      "endMs": 531368
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Now, to take her for a test toast.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 533702,
      "endMs": 536472
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "What the...?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 538507,
      "endMs": 539842
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Look at that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 545948,
      "endMs": 547316
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "I'm the first non-Brazilian person to travel backwards through time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 547483,
      "endMs": 551387
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "Correction, Homer. You're the second.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 551554,
      "endMs": 553289
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "That's right, Mr. Peabody. Quiet, you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 553422,
      "endMs": 555724
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "I've gone back to the time when dinosaurs weren't just confined to zoos.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 561430,
      "endMs": 566969
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Okay, don't panic.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 567870,
      "endMs": 569238
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Remember the advice your father gave you on your wedding day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 569405,
      "endMs": 572508
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "If you ever travel back in time, don't step on anything.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 572675,
      "endMs": 576378
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "Because even the tiniest change...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 576545,
      "endMs": 578814
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "...can alter the future in ways you can't imagine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 578981,
      "endMs": 582284
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Fine. As long as I stand perfectly still and don't touch anything...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 582484,
      "endMs": 586255
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "...I won't destroy the future.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 586455,
      "endMs": 589124
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Stupid bug! You go squish now!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 589525,
      "endMs": 592161
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "That was just one little insignificant mosquito.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 594295,
      "endMs": 596764
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "That can't change the future, right?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 596965,
      "endMs": 599033
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "Right?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 599534,
      "endMs": 601102
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "I'm back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 607475,
      "endMs": 608977
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "My loving family. Nothing's changed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 612947,
      "endMs": 616718
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Hidilly-ho, slave-a-reenos.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 620154,
      "endMs": 622190
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Okilly-dokilly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 622390,
      "endMs": 624058
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Hey, what the hell is that geek Flanders doing on TV?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 624259,
      "endMs": 628229
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "I see by the big board we got a Negative Nelly in sector two.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 629063,
      "endMs": 633034
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "I'm gonna have to ask the whole family to kind of freeze...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 633167,
      "endMs": 635937
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "...and prepare for re-Neducation.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 636104,
      "endMs": 637805
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Don't you remember, Dad?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 638139,
      "endMs": 639340
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Flanders is the unquestioned lord and master of the world.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 639507,
      "endMs": 642176
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Okay, everybody. Let's see some big smiles.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 654022,
      "endMs": 657492
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Just relax. Let the hooks do their work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 660695,
      "endMs": 663064
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "What the hell are you smiling at?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 663831,
      "endMs": 665667
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Now, in case all that smiling didn't cheer you up...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 667035,
      "endMs": 669404
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "...there's one thing that never fails: A nice glass of warm milk, a little nap, and a total frontal lobotomy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 669571,
      "endMs": 675909
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "It's not so bad, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 676310,
      "endMs": 677978
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "They go in through your nose...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 678178,
      "endMs": 680881
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "...and they let you keep the piece of brain they cut out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 681048,
      "endMs": 683984
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Look. Hello.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 684151,
      "endMs": 686353
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Hello there. Who's that big man there? Who's that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 686553,
      "endMs": 690290
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Join us, Father. Join us, Father.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 690491,
      "endMs": 693027
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "It's bliss.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 693227,
      "endMs": 696397
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 697665,
      "endMs": 698799
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "I gotta go back, fix future.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 704882,
      "endMs": 707518
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "This time I'm not gonna touch a thing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 711422,
      "endMs": 713591
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Mustn't crush. Mustn't kill. Made it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 716961,
      "endMs": 719797
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "I wish, I wish I hadn't killed that fish",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 721665,
      "endMs": 724802
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Hey, where is everybody?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 731208,
      "endMs": 733844
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Hey, there's a bug that looks like Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 736413,
      "endMs": 738516
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Let's kill it. Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 738716,
      "endMs": 740718
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "This is gonna cost me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 760970,
      "endMs": 763005
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "I mean, hey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 769145,
      "endMs": 770579
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Good morning, Father, dear. Hope you're well.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 770746,
      "endMs": 773215
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Are we taking the Lexus to Aunt Patty and Selma's funeral today?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 773382,
      "endMs": 776385
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Fabulous house, well-behaved kids, sisters-in-law dead, luxury sedan...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 776719,
      "endMs": 780923
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "I hit the jackpot!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 781557,
      "endMs": 783025
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Marge, dear, would you kindly pass me a doughnut?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 783426,
      "endMs": 786862
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "Doughnut? What's a doughnut?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 787029,
      "endMs": 788831
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "It's raining again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 794470,
      "endMs": 795771
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "You're still not in your own world, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 798941,
      "endMs": 801177
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "I can get you home, but you have to do exactly as I...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 801377,
      "endMs": 805214
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "This is indeed a disturbing universe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 807016,
      "endMs": 809986
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Don't touch anything? I'll touch whatever I feel like!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 810886,
      "endMs": 814657
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "Foolish earthling, totally unprepared for the effects of time travel.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 825801,
      "endMs": 829572
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "What happened to us, Kodos? Quiet, you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 842285,
      "endMs": 844820
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Good morning. What's my name?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 854262,
      "endMs": 855764
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "What color is the sky? What of doughnuts? What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 855930,
      "endMs": 859034
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "For the love of God, tell me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 859200,
      "endMs": 861336
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "Homer, the sky is blue, doughnuts are plentiful, Friday is TGIF night on ABC.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 861503,
      "endMs": 866007
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "What's gotten into you? Nothing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 866174,
      "endMs": 867742
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Nothing at all. Let's just eat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 867876,
      "endMs": 870412
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Close enough.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 877619,
      "endMs": 879154
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "Hey, everybody! Let's all turn our desks backwards...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 887595,
      "endMs": 890198
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "...before Mrs. Krabappel shows up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 890365,
      "endMs": 892200
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Yeah! Great idea!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 892367,
      "endMs": 893802
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "All right, backwards boy, back your butt down to detention.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 898173,
      "endMs": 901309
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Over here, Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 903678,
      "endMs": 904846
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "The detention room is overcrowded, so you'll be serving in the cafeteria.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 905013,
      "endMs": 908350
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Oxygen running out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 908516,
      "endMs": 909751
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "You should've thought of that before you made that paper airplane.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 909918,
      "endMs": 912954
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "This overcrowding in detention is becoming critical.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 914522,
      "endMs": 916925
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "It's a powder keg waiting to go off in an explosion of bad behavior.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 917092,
      "endMs": 920195
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "Don't bitch to me, boss man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 920362,
      "endMs": 921997
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "Thanks to the latest budget cuts, I'm down to using Grade F meat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 922163,
      "endMs": 925166
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "It would be wonderful if there was a common solution to both our problems.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 927135,
      "endMs": 930505
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "That would be great. Hey, Bart. Watch this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 930672,
      "endMs": 933642
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "Oh, no! My favorite outfit!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 935377,
      "endMs": 937912
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Jimbo, this is by far the worst...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 938079,
      "endMs": 941283
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Jimbo, why don't you assist Lunchlady Doris in the kitchen?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 944753,
      "endMs": 948523
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "Bite me, Skinner. Well, might we.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 948690,
      "endMs": 951192
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "It's hard for me to clean this giant pot...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 951493,
      "endMs": 953561
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "...when you keep spilling meat tenderizer all over me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 953728,
      "endMs": 957032
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Oh, great! Now I gotta work in the dark.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 957198,
      "endMs": 960735
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "This sandwich tastes so young and impudent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 966107,
      "endMs": 968476
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Seymour, what's with the good grub?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 969044,
      "endMs": 971012
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Well, perhaps I ought to let you folks in on a secret.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 971212,
      "endMs": 973782
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "You remember me telling Jimbo Jones that I'd make something of him one day?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 973949,
      "endMs": 977485
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Are you saying you killed Jimbo...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 978520,
      "endMs": 980522
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "...processed his carcass, and served him for lunch?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 980689,
      "endMs": 983658
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "I wonder where Jimbo is today.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 990365,
      "endMs": 991900
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "He should've beaten us up for our lunch money an hour ago.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 992100,
      "endMs": 994769
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "Frau Lunchlady, please to have another Sloppy Jimbo?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 994903,
      "endMs": 998239
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "That's your third helping, young man. It's making you fat and soft...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 999541,
      "endMs": 1003378
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "...and tender.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1004112,
      "endMs": 1005780
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "You just cut in line, didn't you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1007048,
      "endMs": 1008750
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "Report to detention, Uter. For how long?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1008917,
      "endMs": 1011353
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "About seven minutes a pound should do it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1011553,
      "endMs": 1013922
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "Okay, I got your German grub right here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1017759,
      "endMs": 1020629
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "Bart, does it strike you as odd that Uter disappeared...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1022664,
      "endMs": 1025233
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "...and suddenly they're serving us this mysterious food called \"Uterbraten\"?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1025400,
      "endMs": 1028770
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "Oh, relax, kids.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1029004,
      "endMs": 1030271
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "I've got a gut feeling Uter's around here somewhere.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1030438,
      "endMs": 1033742
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "After all, isn't there a little Uter in all of us?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1034876,
      "endMs": 1038213
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "In fact, you might even say we just ate Uter...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1041483,
      "endMs": 1044586
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "...and he's in our stomachs right now!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1044753,
      "endMs": 1048056
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Wait, scratch that one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1050058,
      "endMs": 1051793
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Mom! Mom! You've gotta help!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1051993,
      "endMs": 1053695
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "They're cooking kids in the school cafeteria!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1053862,
      "endMs": 1056231
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "Listen, kids, you're 8 and 10 years old now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1056431,
      "endMs": 1058667
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "I can't fight all your battles for you. But, Mom!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1058833,
      "endMs": 1061536
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "No buts. You march right back to that school...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1061736,
      "endMs": 1064406
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "...look them straight in the eye and say, \"Don't eat me.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1064572,
      "endMs": 1067575
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Okay. Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1067742,
      "endMs": 1069244
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "Since so many students have been put on permanent detention...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1073615,
      "endMs": 1077185
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "...we've merged everyone into a single class.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1078253,
      "endMs": 1080488
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "I trust there are no objections?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1080655,
      "endMs": 1083491
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Detention.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1090198,
      "endMs": 1091499
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Hey, you guys, I was just thinking that any one of us could be next.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1102110,
      "endMs": 1107349
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "So, what do you say we make a break for it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1107515,
      "endMs": 1110285
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "Easy there, young man. You'll only make yourself tired and stringy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1122762,
      "endMs": 1125899
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Now to check on the free-range children.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1126066,
      "endMs": 1128602
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "Hold on, kids!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1134107,
      "endMs": 1135375
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "I'm coming to rescue the lot of you! I'll...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1135542,
      "endMs": 1138745
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "I'm bad at this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1139846,
      "endMs": 1141381
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "I'm going to enjoy devouring you, Bart Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1145385,
      "endMs": 1148989
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "Yes, I believe I'll start as you've so often suggested...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1149189,
      "endMs": 1153493
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "...by eating your shorts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1153660,
      "endMs": 1156229
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "Don't worry, guys. Something always comes along to save us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1169009,
      "endMs": 1172479
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "Nevertheless, I remain confident...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1174681,
      "endMs": 1176449
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "...that something will come along and save the two Simpson children.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1176616,
      "endMs": 1179753
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Relax, honey. You were just having a crazy nightmare.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1185625,
      "endMs": 1189129
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "You're back with your family now, where there's nothing to be afraid of...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1189329,
      "endMs": 1192766
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "...except that fog that turns people inside out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1192933,
      "endMs": 1195635
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "It's seeping in.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1197703,
      "endMs": 1199272
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "Stupid, cheap weather stripping!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1199839,
      "endMs": 1201440
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "One chorus line of people Dancing till they make us stop Two!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1211918,
      "endMs": 1220526
    },
    {
